// How much promise news matters. Making a promise is routine business (1) - the reports
// carry it, the rail shows it only for the player's own country. The date arriving, either
// way, is worth the rail (2): a kept promise is rare enough to be worth saying, and a
// broken one is the kind of thing people repeat for years.
{
  "importance": {
    "promise_made": 1,
    "promise_kept": 2,
    "promise_broken": 2
  }
}
